// ALFa overlay for unattended-upgrades (Ubuntu Server / Debian).
// Official: https://ubuntu.com/server/docs/how-to/software/automatic-updates/
// Do not install this file on Proxmox VE, hub, or Linux Mint (secondary).
//
// Security origins stay in 50unattended-upgrades. This file pins reboot off
// and skips packages whose upgrade would take down Docker / GPU / kernel
// without a cluster stop.
//
// Package-Blacklist entries are Python regular expressions anchored at the
// start of the package name (Ubuntu Automatic updates: How to block certain
// packages). A trailing hyphen is a prefix (linux- matches linux-image-*).

Unattended-Upgrade::Automatic-Reboot "false";

Unattended-Upgrade::Package-Blacklist {
        "linux-";
        "nvidia-";
        "docker-";
        "docker.io$";
        "containerd";
};
